hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16703","Abd al-Razzaq narrated to us, he said: Ibn Jurayj informed us, he said: Ubayd Allah ibn Abi Yazid informed me that Abd al-Rahman ibn Tariq ibn Alqama informed him, from his uncle, that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) when he came to a place of the house of Yala, Ubayd Allah specified it, would face the qibla and supplicate; and Rawh said: from his father, and Ibn Bakr said: from his mother."
